## Interface: 16001
## Title: Combat
## Notes: Sane UI's frames for the fight, being built. Docked at the screen's bottom middle: push the mouse against the middle of the bottom edge, or press your spellbook or talents key, and our own talents and spellbook fill the screen side by side, as the game's; push there again, or Esc, and they go back.
## Author: Saneroki
## Version: 0.3.0
## Category: Sane UI
## Group: SaneUI
